OL,3,GNEWSAThe winners of Lincolnshire Make a
OL,4,ADifference
OL,5,
OL,6,FJo Thompson, one of the award winners,
OL,7,Fsaid: "Someone here said it's about the
OL,8,Fcause not the applause and I think that
OL,9,Fcompletely encapsulates many of us here
OL,10,Ftoday."
